cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MapForge in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MicroMap MapForge (Graphomics)"
abstract: >-
  A reviewable ingestion pipeline for biomedical knowledge graphs.
  Turns raw tabular data into parameterized Cypher bundles that a
  reviewer can approve before any node lands in Neo4j. Part of the
  Graphomics MicroMap platform; not affiliated with the identically-named
  MicroMap microbiome-metabolism visualization resource (Thiele lab,
  npj Biofilms and Microbiomes, 2025).
authors:
  - family-names: Khandavalli
    given-names: Varun
    affiliation: Graphomics
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/vkhangraphomics/micromap-oss/tree/main/micromap-mapforge"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - knowledge-graph
  - neo4j
  - biomedical
  - microbiome
  - data-ingestion
  - biocypher
